cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SentinelGate in your research or production systems, please cite it as below."
title: "SentinelGate: Zero-Bloat, OpenAI-Compatible LLM Gateway with In-Process Semantic Caching"
abstract: "A high-throughput, zero-bloat OpenAI-compatible LLM Gateway featuring in-process semantic caching via FastEmbed ONNX, automatic circuit breaker failovers, reversible secret redaction, and sub-millisecond complexity cost routing, backed strictly by SQLite WAL mode."
